OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland owner in crunch talks
OL,4,Awith business secretary as retailer's
OL,5,Acollapse looms
OL,6,
OL,7,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,8,Fwill meet the US-based owners of
OL,9,FPoundland on Wednesday as the
OL,10,Fgovernment hopes to save the retailer
OL,11,Ffrom collapse.
OL,13,FThe discount chain is on the brink of
OL,14,Finsolvency and Gordon Brothers, which
OL,15,Fbought it for #1 last June, has
OL,16,Frejected a takeover bid which could
OL,17,Fhave saved the 12,000 jobs currently at
OL,18,Frisk.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
